  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNDP/UNCDF Climate Change Finance 2023-2027 - UNDP Climate Change Finance 2023-2027</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">UNDP/UNCDF Klimatfinansiering 2023-2027</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Overall goal:
Impact: Bangladesh, Cambodia, Nepal, Solomon Islands and Tuvalu are building inclusive climate resilient communities and local economies and are transitioning towards low carbon development pathways. 

Medium term outcome: Climate governance is strengthened in a gender responsive manner and additional climate finance is leveraged at the national, sectoral and sub-national levels in Bangladesh, Cambodia, Nepal, Solomon Islands and Tuvalu. 

Outcome 1: Public sector at national, sectoral and local levels has enhanced capacities for effective planning of climate finance. 

Outcome 2:Climate Change is mainstreamed into national/ local governments&apos; planning and budgeting systems and lead to allocations/investments.

Outcome 3: Country frameworks and systems established and/or strengthened for increased access to climate finance (public, private, domestic, international).

Outcome 4: Enhanced inclusiveness, transparency and accountability of climate finance.

Outcome 5: Strengthened regional cooperation to enable climate finance reforms in the region.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNDP and UNCDF will 2023-2027 work to Strengthen the Governance of Climate Finance and to promote inclusive climate resilience in Asia and the Pacific. The project focuses on the following objectives: 

* Impact:&#xA0;Bangladesh, Cambodia, Nepal, Solomon Islands and Tuvalu are building inclusive climate resilient communities and local economies and are transitioning towards low carbon development pathways.&#xA0;

* Medium term outcome:&#xA0;Climate governance is strengthened in a gender responsive&#xA0;manner and additional climate finance is leveraged at the national, sectoral&#xA0;and sub-national&#xA0;levels&#xA0;in Bangladesh, Cambodia, Nepal, Solomon Islands and Tuvalu.&#xA0;

* Outcome 1:&#xA0;Public sector at national, sectoral&#xA0;and&#xA0;local&#xA0;levels has enhanced capacities&#xA0;for effective planning of climate finance.&#xA0;
* Outcome 2:Climate Change is mainstreamed into national/ local governments&apos; planning and budgeting systems and lead to allocations/investments.
* Outcome 3:&#xA0;Country&#xA0;frameworks and systems established and/or strengthened for increased access to climate finance (public, private, domestic, international).
* Outcome 4:&#xA0;Enhanced inclusiveness, transparency and accountability of climate finance.
* Outcome 5:&#xA0;Strengthened regional cooperation to enable climate finance reforms in the region.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">UNDP och UNCDF kommer 2023-2027 att arbeta f&#xF6;r att st&#xE4;rka styrningen av klimatfinansiering och f&#xF6;r att fr&#xE4;mja klimatresilient och inkluderade utveckling i Asien och Oceanien. Projektet fokuserar p&#xE5; f&#xF6;ljande m&#xE5;l:

* L&#xE5;ngsiktig effekt:&#xA0;Bangladesh, Kambodja, Nepal, Salomon&#xF6;arna och Tuvalu bygger inkluderande klimatt&#xE5;liga samh&#xE4;llen och lokala ekonomier och &#xF6;verg&#xE5;r till utvecklingsv&#xE4;gar med l&#xE5;ga koldioxidutsl&#xE4;pp.

* Effekt p&#xE5; medell&#xE5;ng sikt:&#xA0;Klimatstyrningen st&#xE4;rks p&#xE5; ett j&#xE4;mst&#xE4;lldhetsintegrerat s&#xE4;tt och ytterligare klimatfinansiering mobiliseras p&#xE5; nationella, sektoriella och subnationella niv&#xE5;er i Bangladesh, Kambodja, Nepal, Salomon&#xF6;arna och Tuvalu.

* Kortsiktigt resultat 1:&#xA0;Offentlig sektor p&#xE5; nationell, sektoriell&#xA0;och lokal niv&#xE5; har f&#xF6;rb&#xE4;ttrad kapacitet&#xA0;f&#xF6;r effektiv planering av klimatfinansiering.
* Kortsiktigt resultat 2:&#xA0;Klimat integreras i nationella/lokala myndigheters planerings- och budgetsystem och leder till anslag/investeringar.
* Kortsiktigt resultat 3:&#xA0;Landramverk och system etableras och/eller st&#xE4;rks f&#xF6;r &#xF6;kad tillg&#xE5;ng till klimatfinansiering (offentlig, privat, inhemsk, internationell).
* Kortsiktigt resultat 4:&#xA0;F&#xF6;rb&#xE4;ttrad inkludering, transparens och ansvarsutkr&#xE4;vande f&#xF6;r klimatfinansiering.
* Kortsiktigt resultat 5:&#xA0;St&#xE4;rkt regionalt samarbete f&#xF6;r att m&#xF6;jligg&#xF6;ra klimatfinansieringsreformer i regionen.</narrative>
  </description>
